This BankingAssistant application runs on port no 9000 defined in properties
Before running ensure api key is added to environment path variables with myKey
we have total 4 api rest end points to test the use case

This application is enabled with basic auth for the following endpoints with 2 roles
TESTUSER - USER role
TESTADMIN - ADMIN role

both roles uses same username and password
Username : TESTUSER
Password : TESTUSER

Using admin role we can access audit end point where we can see all the prompts used.

1.http://localhost:9000/api/enquiries/summarize

request
{
 "customerReference": "CUST-DEMO-104",
 "channel": "WEB",
 "message": "My transfer of INR 4500 shows failed, but the amount seems deducted. What should I do?"
}

response
