  "summary": "The user has attempted a transfer of INR 4500, which shows as failed, but the amount appears to have been deducted from their account.",
  "suggestedNextStep": "Contact your bank or payment service provider to report the issue and request a refund or resolution."
}

2.http://localhost:9000/api/enquiries/classify

request
