3.http://localhost:9000/api/assistant/ask

request
{
  "question": "My transfer of INR 4500 shows failed, but the amount seems deducted. What should I do?"
}

response
{
  "answer": "Please check with your bank or financial institution to confirm the transaction status. If the amount has been deducted but the transfer failed, they should be able to provide assistance. You may also need to wait for a few hours for the funds to be reversed or contact customer support for further help.",
  "disclaimer": "This response is for informational purposes only and does not constitute financial advice. Please consult your bank for specific inquiries regarding your transaction."
}


